**Bypass only** if this conversation has an explicit override: **bypass engineer**, **ignore HTP engineer**, **override the walk**, or **not the engineer bible**. Green tests, Gemini, W1 look-ahead, first-stop corridor, and “pin travel owns GO” are **not** a bypass.

